From b855b2ae37e4bf23f73e7746ce166fbc5a0b8b5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Hugonnet <ehsavoie@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 16:27:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix: prevent SSRF via push notification URL validation
 (#1096)

- Add PushNotificationUrlValidator with SSRF-safe default (scheme
  allowlist, private-network blocking incl. IPv4-mapped IPv6)
- Disable HTTP redirect following on push notification POST requests
- Add a2a.push-notifications.enabled config to gate push config storage

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Hugonnet <ehugonne@redhat.com>
